# Go/TinyGo benchmarks - benchmarks compiled with both standard Go and TinyGo.
#
# TinyGo is a Go compiler designed for small places, producing compact
# WebAssembly binaries suitable for resource-constrained environments.
# Standard Go produces larger binaries but may have different performance characteristics.

# TinyGo builds (smaller, optimized for size)
go/tinygo-json.wasm
go/tinygo-regex.wasm

# Standard Go builds (larger, default compiler)
go/go-json.wasm
go/go-regex.wasm
